{
  "page": 497,
  "lang": "ar",
  "edition": "quran-uthmani",
  "ayahs": [
    {
      "number": 4433,
      "text": "Dan jangalah kamu menyombongkan diri terhadap Allah. Sungguh, aku datang kepadamu dengan membawa bukti yang nyata.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 44,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الدُّخَانِ",
        "englishName": "Ad-Dukhaan",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Smoke",
        "numberOfAyahs": 59,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 19,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 497,
      "ruku": 431,
      "hizbQuarter": 199,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4434,
      "text": "Dan sesungguhnya aku berlindung kepada Tuhanku dan Tuhanmu, dari ancamanmu untuk merajamku.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 44,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الدُّخَانِ",
        "englishName": "Ad-Dukhaan",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Smoke",
        "numberOfAyahs": 59,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 20,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 497,
      "ruku": 431,
      "hizbQuarter": 199,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4435,
      "text": "Dan jika kamu tidak beriman kepadaku, maka biarkanlah aku (memimpin Bani Israil).\"",
      "surah": {
        "number": 44,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الدُّخَانِ",
        "englishName": "Ad-Dukhaan",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Smoke",
        "numberOfAyahs": 59,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 21,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 497,
      "ruku": 431,
      "hizbQuarter": 199,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4436,
      "text": "Kemudian dia (Musa) berdoa kepada Tuhannya, \"Sungguh, mereka ini adalah kaum yang berdosa (segerakanlah azab kepada mereka).\"",
      "surah": {
        "number": 44,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الدُّخَانِ",
        "englishName": "Ad-Dukhaan",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Smoke",
        "numberOfAyahs": 59,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 22,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 497,
      "ruku": 431,
      "hizbQuarter": 199,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4437,
      "text": "(Allah berfirman), \"Karena itu berjalanlah dengan hamba-hamba-Ku pada malam hari, sesungguhnya kamu akan dikejar,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 44,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الدُّخَانِ",
        "englishName": "Ad-Dukhaan",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Smoke",
        "numberOfAyahs": 59,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 23,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 497,
      "ruku": 431,
      "hizbQuarter": 199,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4438,
      "text": "dan biarkanlah laut itu terbelah. Sesungguhnya mereka bala tentara yang akan ditenggelamkan.\"",
      "surah": {
        "number": 44,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الدُّخَانِ",
        "englishName": "Ad-Dukhaan",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Smoke",
        "numberOfAyahs": 59,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 24,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 497,
      "ruku": 431,
      "hizbQuarter": 199,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4439,
      "text": "Betapa banyak taman-taman dan mata air-mata air yang mereka tinggalkan,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 44,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الدُّخَانِ",
        "englishName": "Ad-Dukhaan",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Smoke",
        "numberOfAyahs": 59,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 25,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 497,
      "ruku": 431,
      "hizbQuarter": 199,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4440,
      "text": "juga kebun-kebun serta tempat-tempat kediaman yang indah,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 44,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الدُّخَانِ",
        "englishName": "Ad-Dukhaan",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Smoke",
        "numberOfAyahs": 59,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 26,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 497,
      "ruku": 431,
      "hizbQuarter": 199,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4441,
      "text": "dan kesenangan-kesenangan yang dapat mereka nikmati di sana.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 44,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الدُّخَانِ",
        "englishName": "Ad-Dukhaan",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Smoke",
        "numberOfAyahs": 59,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 27,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 497,
      "ruku": 431,
      "hizbQuarter": 199,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4442,
      "text": "Demikianlah, dan Kami wariskan (semua) itu kepada kaum yang lain.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 44,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الدُّخَانِ",
        "englishName": "Ad-Dukhaan",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Smoke",
        "numberOfAyahs": 59,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 28,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 497,
      "ruku": 431,
      "hizbQuarter": 199,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4443,
      "text": "Maka langit dan bumi tidak menangisi mereka, dan mereka pun tidak diberi penangguhan waktu.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 44,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الدُّخَانِ",
        "englishName": "Ad-Dukhaan",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Smoke",
        "numberOfAyahs": 59,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 29,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 497,
      "ruku": 431,
      "hizbQuarter": 199,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4444,
      "text": "Dan sungguh, telah Kami selamatkan Bani Israil dari siksaan yang menghinakan,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 44,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الدُّخَانِ",
        "englishName": "Ad-Dukhaan",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Smoke",
        "numberOfAyahs": 59,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 30,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 497,
      "ruku": 432,
      "hizbQuarter": 199,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4445,
      "text": "dari (siksaan) Fir'aun, sungguh, dia itu orang yang sombong, termasuk orang-orang yang melampaui batas.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 44,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الدُّخَانِ",
        "englishName": "Ad-Dukhaan",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Smoke",
        "numberOfAyahs": 59,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 31,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 497,
      "ruku": 432,
      "hizbQuarter": 199,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4446,
      "text": "Dan sungguh, Kami pilih mereka (Bani Israil) dengan ilmu (Kami) di atas semua bangsa (pada masa itu).",
      "surah": {
        "number": 44,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الدُّخَانِ",
        "englishName": "Ad-Dukhaan",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Smoke",
        "numberOfAyahs": 59,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 32,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 497,
      "ruku": 432,
      "hizbQuarter": 199,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4447,
      "text": "Dan telah Kami berikan kepada mereka di antara tanda-tanda (kebesaran Kami) sesuatu yang di dalamnya terdapat nikmat yang nyata.[796]",
      "surah": {
        "number": 44,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الدُّخَانِ",
        "englishName": "Ad-Dukhaan",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Smoke",
        "numberOfAyahs": 59,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 33,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 497,
      "ruku": 432,
      "hizbQuarter": 199,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4448,
      "text": "Sesungguhnya mereka (kaum musyrik) itu pasti akan berkata,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 44,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الدُّخَانِ",
        "englishName": "Ad-Dukhaan",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Smoke",
        "numberOfAyahs": 59,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 34,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 497,
      "ruku": 432,
      "hizbQuarter": 199,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4449,
      "text": "\"Tidak ada kematian selain kematian di dunia ini. Dan kami tidak akan dibangkitkan,[797]",
      "surah": {
        "number": 44,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الدُّخَانِ",
        "englishName": "Ad-Dukhaan",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Smoke",
        "numberOfAyahs": 59,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 35,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 497,
      "ruku": 432,
      "hizbQuarter": 199,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4450,
      "text": "maka hadirkanlah (kembali) nenek moyang kami jika kamu orang yang benar.\"",
      "surah": {
        "number": 44,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الدُّخَانِ",
        "englishName": "Ad-Dukhaan",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Smoke",
        "numberOfAyahs": 59,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 36,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 497,
      "ruku": 432,
      "hizbQuarter": 199,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4451,
      "text": "Apakah mereka (kaum musyrikin) yang lebih baik atau kaum Tubba',[798] dan orang-orang sebelum mereka yang telah Kami binasakan karena mereka adalah orang-orang yang sungguh berdosa.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 44,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الدُّخَانِ",
        "englishName": "Ad-Dukhaan",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Smoke",
        "numberOfAyahs": 59,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 37,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 497,
      "ruku": 432,
      "hizbQuarter": 199,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4452,
      "text": "Dan tidaklah Kami bermain-main menciptakan langit dan serta dan apa yang ada di antara keduanya.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 44,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الدُّخَانِ",
        "englishName": "Ad-Dukhaan",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Smoke",
        "numberOfAyahs": 59,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 38,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 497,
      "ruku": 432,
      "hizbQuarter": 199,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4453,
      "text": "Tidaklah Kami ciptakan keduanya melainkan dengan hak (benar), tetapi kebanyakan mereka tidak mengetahui.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 44,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الدُّخَانِ",
        "englishName": "Ad-Dukhaan",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Smoke",
        "numberOfAyahs": 59,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 39,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 497,
      "ruku": 432,
      "hizbQuarter": 199,
      "sajda": false
    }
  ],
